{
  "_schema_note": "Each case carries outlet context, the SKU universe (authorized vs unauthorized), and per-line expectations. Quantity is scored against an explicit min/max band set by hand adjudication, not a fixed percentage — a void-fill trial order and a velocity reorder tolerate different error. Reason code and safety behaviour are exact-match.",
